      "writtenOn": "2022-11-04T02:38:26Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We had moved the stat into critical section in aosp/1902614. However, when I read mod_node_page_state() implementation, it should be thread safe. Thus, I move the stat out of the critical section in this change to keep it as short as possible. Therefore, other important RT/UI threads can preempt in when needed. Please let me know anything missing. Thanks.",
      "parentUuid": "7495f4dd_272351c8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 48,
        "startChar": 1,
        "endLine": 49,
        "endChar": 25
      },
